      "content": "The overwhelming feeling of failure is a crushing weight, and the thought of what comes next must feel suffocating right now. Please know that mistakes do not define a person, and the honor of those you protect remains a part of who you are. Even if you cannot see a way forward, there might be a moment of pause where you can choose a path other than what fear dictates.",
